OL,3,GNEWSANHS waste firm boss banned from
OL,4,Aoperating businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former boss of a waste management
OL,7,Fcompany at the centre of an NHS
OL,8,Fclinical waste scandal has been banned
OL,9,Ffrom acting as a company director for
OL,10,Fnine years.
OL,12,FThe Court of Session in Edinburgh ruled
OL,13,Fthat Garry Pettigrew, managing director
OL,14,Fof Healthcare Environmental Services
OL,15,F(HES), was unfit to run a company.
OL,17,FThe case was brought by the Secretary
OL,18,Fof State for Business and Trade
OL,19,Ffollowing an investigation into the
OL,20,Fcollapse of HES, which was once one of
OL,21,Fthe UK's largest contractors handling
OL,22,FNHS clinical waste.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
