OL,3,GNEWSANHS waste firm boss banned from
OL,4,Aoperating businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FLord Lake said Pettigrew had "acted in
OL,7,Fbreach of his fiduciary duties as a
OL,8,Fdirector" by entering contracts while
OL,9,F"bordering on insolvency".
